<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://kenaz123.github.io/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://kenaz123.github.io/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-07-11T16:05:06+00:00</updated><id>https://kenaz123.github.io/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>A corner for my thoughts.</subtitle><entry><title type="html">Graduation Memory in NJU</title><link href="https://kenaz123.github.io/blog/2026/graduation-memory-in-nju/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Graduation Memory in NJU"/><published>2026-06-21T17:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-06-21T17:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://kenaz123.github.io/blog/2026/graduation-memory-in-nju</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://kenaz123.github.io/blog/2026/graduation-memory-in-nju/"><![CDATA[<p>Four years compress into an afternoon pretty fast. B.S. in Computer Science and Technology, done — cap, gown, and a bouquet of flowers I had no idea what to do with.</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/grad/grad-selfie-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/grad/grad-selfie-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/grad/grad-selfie-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/grad/grad-selfie.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="caption"> 毕业快乐 — portrait day, chalkboard included. </div> <p>Then it was the whole cohort, packed shoulder to shoulder for the ceremony itself.</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/grad/grad-uiuc-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/grad/grad-uiuc-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/grad/grad-uiuc-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/grad/grad-uiuc.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="caption"> Commencement, somewhere in a sea of black and gold. </div> <p>Some of the best parts of the last four years had nothing to do with coursework or papers — they were the people. Roommates who put up with my deadlines, labmates who turned late nights into something worth remembering, and a few detours to other campuses along the way.</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/grad/grad-roommates-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/grad/grad-roommates-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/grad/grad-roommates-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/grad/grad-roommates.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/grad/grad-junhao-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/grad/grad-junhao-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/grad/grad-junhao-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/grad/grad-junhao.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="caption"> With my roommates in front of 南楼, one of NJU's oldest buildings — and one last walk around campus with friends before everyone scattered. </div> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/grad/grad-highschool-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/grad/grad-highschool-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/grad/grad-highschool-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/grad/grad-highschool.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="caption"> A detour to Tongji University with my high school classmates. </div> <p>NJU is where I actually learned how to do research — from stumbling through my first project to co-authoring papers with people I now consider close friends. It is also where this website’s story started. Next stop: Urbana-Champaign, for my M.S. in Computer Science at UIUC.</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="Musings"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Looking back on four years at Nanjing University before heading to UIUC.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Hello, welcome to my homepage</title><link href="https://kenaz123.github.io/blog/2025/welcome/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Hello, welcome to my homepage"/><published>2025-12-21T04:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-12-21T04:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://kenaz123.github.io/blog/2025/welcome</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://kenaz123.github.io/blog/2025/welcome/"><![CDATA[<p>Thanks for stopping by! This site is a living notebook for my research updates and ongoing projects. More posts coming soon.</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Thanks for stopping by! This site is a living notebook for my research updates and ongoing projects. More posts coming soon.]]></summary></entry></feed>